                            It's Official! Maynard's New Ballot Drop Box Is Installed and Ready!



 Residents can now conveniently return their ballots using the new drop box located in front of Town Hall at 195 Main Street, in the same location as the previous ballot drop box.  Please Note:  The drop box is currently in a temporary location while our Department of Public Works prepares its permanent home. We wanted to make sure this convenient option was available to voters in time for the upcoming election! A Few Friendly Reminders: Make sure you sign your ballot return envelope! This election has TWO ballot cards, so please make sure you return BOTH! All ballots must be received by 8:00 PM on Election Day, Tuesday, November 3, 2026. A big thank you to our DPW team for getting the new drop box installed and ready for our residents. We appreciate your help!                      



